  <para style="mt1">Esta</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s1">Edooro Abọọñanwaan Fasti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />Se ikitịppe ke ini ukara adidem Seeses<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru anye asʌk ado Ahasuerus mi ye ke afịd ñwed Esta.</char></note> akedo ami, Seeses a-akekarake afịd mme abio ikie keed mme edịb mme itiaba (127) atọọñọ ke India tutu akewuọ Kuus: <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" />Ke ini ado Adidem Seeses akeda ukara ebekpo ubọọñ amọ ke sitadeel Susa, <verse eid="EST 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />ndin ke ayọhọ isua ukara amọ ita anye amaanam ekamba usọrọ anọ afịd mme awuọiso awo amọ ye mme adaaha amọ. Mme ikpọawo ekọñ ake Pesia ye Madai, nditọ ideen ndidem, mbọọñ ye mme awuọiso awo ke mme abio emaeba.<verse eid="EST 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Anye amaadat usen ikie mme anaañ (180) awọt akwa inie abio amọ adian ye uku ye mmọnyọ ye ubọọñ amọ. <verse eid="EST 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Ke mme usen ami emaekeboiyo, adidem amaasịn ekamba usọrọ, akekpeeneke ke usen itiaba, ke akpọ-akpọ inwañ nduọkadudu adidem, anọ afịd mme awo tọọñọ ke etək-etək tutu awuọ ekamba e-ekebaaha ke sitadeel Susa. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Inwañesa ami amaanie mme afia ye bru afọñ linen, ekedatta udʌk afia afọñ linen ye iduod-iduod afọñ ebọp edian ke mme ñkpannuun silfa ke adaaha mabịd. Mme ñnyʌkkọ mbere ñkpọitie kold ye silfa emaeba ke mboodesa pọfiri, mabịd, peel ye mme nsọñudua itiad mfen. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Emaenọ mme awo ukọd ke mme iko kold, ammọ emaenie ukpʌhọde ye emọ-emọ, ndin ukọd ubọọñ akedo barasuene, naña asaña akekem ye mfọọn ubọk enọ adidem. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Ke uyio adidem afịd isenawo akena nte enwọñ ukọd naña emama, awo ikpanna ammọ, sia adidem amaanọ afịd nditọufọk se ideeme ukọd yak enọ awo keedekeed se anye ayeyem.<verse eid="EST 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Abọọñanwaan Fasti amaanyʌñ asịn usọrọ anọ mme ibaan ke akwere Adidem Seeses.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, ke ini Adidem Seeses amaakekpa mmịn, anye amaanọ mme itọ itiaba esinamma ñkpọ enọ anye: Mehuman, Bista, Habona, Bikta, Abakta, Setaa ye Kaakas, <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />uyio ate eben Abọọñanwaan Fasti edi ke iso imọ, ayara anyanya ubọọñ amọ, nọ anye awọt mme awo ye mme mbọọñ uyai amọ, sia anye amaayaiya se ese. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Ado ke ini mme isʌñutom emaekenọ etob adidem, Abọọñanwaan Fasti amaasịn adidi. Ndin adidem amaayat esịd eti-eti anyʌñ akpa ifiobesịd.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />Sia akesidooho ido adidem adibịp mme ntaifiọk mbaña mme ñkpọ mbed ye unen, anye amaaneme ye mbon aniọñ e-ekediọọñọke mme ini, <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" />ndin ammọ ekenyʌñ enekke ekpere adidem idem: Kasena, Setaa, Admata, Taasis, Meres, Masena ye Memukan, mme mbọọñ Pesia ye Madai itiaba e-ekenekkeke ekpere adidem ndin ammọ ekekpoon awo ekan ke abio.<verse eid="EST 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Adidem amaabịp ate, “Ke naña mbed atemme, nsoo ke ekpenam Abọọñanwaan Fasti? Anye inamma uyio Adidem Seeses ake mme itọ ekebenne esọk anye.”<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Akem Memukan amaabọọrọ ke iso adidem ye mme mbọọñ, “Abọọñanwaan Fasti adue, idooho ye adidem ikpọọñ ado ye afịd mme mbọọñ ye mme mbon abio Adidem Seeses. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Sia afịd ibaan eyaediọọñọ ebaña adinam abọọñanwaan, ndin ammọ eyaemiom mme ebe ammọ enyʌñ ebo, ‘Adidem Seeses amaanọ uyio ate ekoot Abọọñanwaan Fasti enọ imọ, ado anye asịn adidi.’ <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Kpa usen mfịn ami mme ibaan Pesia ye Media e-etooho ubon ubọọñ e-ekoppo ido abọọñanwaan eyaebọọrọ afịd mbọọñ adidem ke ukem usʌñ ami. Utịd usọñanyen ye utọk idiibaaha.<verse eid="EST 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />“Ke ntoro, adieke adidem anyịmmeke, yak anye anọ ewʌhọ anyʌñ awet ñwed ke mbed Pesia ye Media, ake awo imiikemeke adibiat, ate ke Fasti idiidʌkkọ iso Adidem Seeses aba ke nsi-nsi. Ñko yak adidem aben itie ubọọñ amọ anọ awo mfen a-afọnnọ akan anye. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />Ndin ke ini emaekoot ewʌhọ adidem ke afịd abio ukara amọ, afịd ibaan eyaekpono mme ebe ammọ, tọọñọ ke etək-etək tutu asịm ekamba.”<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Adidem ye mme mbọọñ amọ emaenem esịd ebaña item ami, ndin adidem amaanam naña Memukan aketemme. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />Anye amaadọñ mme etob eka ke afịd mme abio, ke mme idịd keedekeed ke ubọk ñwed amọ ye afịd mme awo ke nsio-nsio usem ammọ, asian abo yak ideen edo mme andikara ke ufọk ammọ, ekama usem ammọ enam ado.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s1">Enam Esta Abọọñanwaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Akema ke ini ifiobesịd Adidem Seeses amaakesuuhọ, anye amaatoiyo Fasti ye se anye akenam ndin ye se anye akewuuk abaña anye. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Akem asaña-asaña ayịnufọk adidem amaabo, “Yak eyeem mme uyaiya mboppo abọikpa enọ adidem. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Yak adidem amek mme akamautom ke afịd idak ukara amọ adiben afịd mme uyaiya ubọikpa ami ndi ke esịd akwere adidem ke sitadeel Susa. Yak esịn ammọ ke idak ukpeme Hekai, itọ adidem, a-aseeghe ñkpọ abaña ibaan; ndin yak esịn ammọ ke ñkʌhọ uyai. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Ndin yak ayịn abọikpa ake anemme adidem esịd ado abọọñanwaan ke itie Fasti.” Item ami amaanem adidem esịd, ndin anye amaadat item ami.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Ndin awo Yuu amaaba ke sitadeel Susa aketooho aduuk Benyamin, anyịñ amọ akedo Mọdekai ayịn Yai, ayịn Simei, ayịn Kisi, <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />ake Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn akebenne nte afʌn akpọñ Yeruselem ke atu mbon se ekeben ye Yehoiyakịn adidem Yuda. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Mọdekai amaanie ayakka a-akekereke Hadasa, ake anye akekamake sia anye ikinieghe ete me eka. Ayịn abọikpa ami, a-akenyʌññọ akere Esta, amaanie uyaiya idem ndin amaayaiya eti-eti. Mọdekai akedat anye nte ayịn amọ ke ini ete ye eka amọ emaekekpa.<verse eid="EST 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Ke ini emaekesian ewʌhọ adidem ye mbed amọ, emaeben ataa uwak ubọikpa edi ke abio Susa enyʌñ esịn ke idak ukpeme Hekai. Emaeben Esta ñko ekaa ke akwere adidem enyʌñ eyaak anye esịn ke ukpeme Hekai, a-akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña ubeed ibaan. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Esta amaanem Hekai esịd ndin anye amaanie mfọn ato Hekai. Ke usọp-usọp anye amaasịn anye ke ñkʌhọ uyai anyʌñ anọ anye asaña-asaña ndidia. Anye amaamek nditọufọk ibaan itiaba e-ekesioho ke akwere adidem anọ Esta anyʌñ aben anye ye nditọufọk amọ asịn ke itie a-afọnnọ akan ke esa ibaan.<verse eid="EST 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Esta ikiyaarake abio ye ubon amọ, sia Mọdekai amaakpan anye adinam ntoro. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Afịd usen Mọdekai amaasisaña akaa iso ye edem ke ñkpere akwere ufọk ibaan adise me abadie ye Esta ye se itịppe ye anye.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Mbemiso akem ini a-anaaha nte abọikpa adʌk akeba ye Adidem Seeses, ana anye abeeñe idem ñkʌhọ uyai ke afiọñ duob mme iba naña ekenịm enọ ibaan, ana akama afiọñ itiokeed ayie adan mee anyʌñ adat afiọñ itiokeed ayie pefium ye mme ñkpọ mbanaidem. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Ndin naña anye adiika ibịne adidem ado ami: Ñkpọ keed akeedodo anye akeyemme adiben nto esa ibaan ñkaa akwere adidem ado se ekenọọ anye. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Ndubiayio anye ayaakaa do ndin ke ubakusen anye anyọñ akaa akeba ke ufọk ubeed ibaan mfen ake Saaskas, itọ adidem a-akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña ibaan esa adidem. Anye idiikaaha aba ibịne adidem ibọhọke adidem ayʌkkọ ye anye anyʌñ adọñ ekoot anye ke anyịñ.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Ini a-akenaaha nte Esta (abọikpa ake Mọdekai akedatta abon, ayịn ayakka ete amọ Abihel) aka abịne adidem akekem, anye ikiyemme ñkpọ ndomokeed ibọhọke se Hekai, itọ adidem akesiak. Ndin Esta amaakịt mfọn ato afịd awo se ikikịt anye. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Emaeben Esta esọk Adidem Seeses ke ufọk ubọọñ ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob, afiọñ Tebed, ke ayọhọ isua ukara amọ itiaba.<verse eid="EST 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Adidem amaama Esta akan afịd mme ibaan mfen, ndin anye amaabọ mfọn adidem ye unyịmme akan afịd mme ubọikpa mbon ñko. Ndin adidem amaadot anye anyanya ubọọñ ke iwuod anyʌñ anam anye abọọñanwaan ke itie Fasti. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Ndin adidem amaanam ekamba usọrọ, usọrọ Esta, anọ afịd mme ikpọawo ye mme adaaha amọ. Anye amaasian usen nduọkadudu ke afịd abio ukara amọ anyʌñ adeeme mme enọ asañake ye idiọọñọ mfọọnubọk ubọọñ.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mọdekai Ayaara Idiọọk Adu abaña Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Ke ini mme ubọikpa ekebonoke ayọhọ akañ iba, Mọdekai aketie ke inuaatob adidem. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Ado Esta amaadịp ntịppe abio ye ufọk anye aketooho kpa naña Mọdekai akedọkkọ anye, sia anye amaakaa iso anịm mme item Mọdekai naña anye akekpeep anye.<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Ke idaha Mọdekai aketieghe ke inuaatob adidem, Biktana ye Teres, mme adaaha adidem iba e-ekesikpemeke inuausʌñ, emaekop iyadesịd enyʌñ etọọñọ edidʌk idiọọk udu ediwot Adidem Seeses. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Ado Mọdekai amaayaara adiọọñọ abaña uduak ami anyʌñ adọkkọ Abọọñanwaan Esta, a-akebenne akedọkkọ adidem, ate ke Mọdekai akekop adu ami. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Ke ini ekeduuñọke ñkpọ ami ekịt ke ado akpanikọ, emaeyịt mme adaaha iba ami ke abọbọọk. Afịd ñkpọ ami emaewet ke ñwed ñkpọntịppe ke iso adidem.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uduak Haman Adisobo mme Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Ke ñkpọ ami amaakeboiyo, Adidem Seeses amaakpono Haman ayịn Hamedata, awo Akak, adịppe anye anyʌñ anọ anye ifịm ukpono akponno akan ake afịd mme adaaha mfen. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Afịd mme adaaha ke inuaatob adidem emaetọọñọ edọñ enyʌñ enọ Haman ukpono, sia adidem amaanọ ewʌhọ abaña anye. Ado Mọdekai ikitọọñọke edọñ ikinyʌññọ inọ anye ukpono.<verse eid="EST 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Akem mme ikpọ mbon ukara ke inuaatob adidem emaebịp Mọdekai, “Nsoo inam nọ afo umuunamma ewʌhọ adidem?” <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Ke usen ke usen ammọ etañ ikọ ye anye ado anye asịn adinam se ammọ ebo. Ke ntoro ammọ emaedọkkọ Haman adise mme eyaeyọ eduuwem Mọdekai, sia anye amaadọkkọ ammọ ke imọ ido awo Yuu.<verse eid="EST 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Ke ini Haman akekịtte ke Mọdekai imaaha aditọọñọ edọñ me adikpono imọ, anye amaakpa iyadesịd. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Ado ke ini anye amaakediọọñọ mbon ubon Mọdekai, anye amaabiat uduak adiwot Mọdekai ikpọọñ. Ado Haman amaayem usʌñ adisobo afịd ubon Mọdekai, mme Yuu, ke afịd abio Seeses.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Ke ayọhọ isua itiaba ke ukara Adidem Seeses, ke akpa afiọñ, ke afiọñ Nisan, <char style="tl">pur</char> (a-adooho, usịn ukañ) emaesịn ukañ ke iso Haman adimek usen ye afiọñ. Ndin afia ami amaaduọ ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme iba, ke afiọñ Adaa.<verse eid="EST 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Akem Haman amaabo Adidem Seeses ate, “Aba utọ ibon e-esuanake eyọhọ afịd itie ke afịd abio mfo e-ebakkake idem ammọ enịm. Mme edu unam ñkpọ ammọ anie ukpʌhọde ye ake mbon mfen, ndin ammọ inịmme mbed adidem; ibaaha ke ufọn adidem adiyọ ammọ. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Adieke anemme adidem esịd, yak enọ ewʌhọ adisobo ammọ, ndin ami ñyaanọ mme akama utom akʌk itie ubonoñkpọ adidem talen silfa tọsịn duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 375 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 340</char></note>.”<verse eid="EST 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Ndin adidem amaasio ñkpannuun idiọọñọ amọ ke nnuun anọ Haman ayịn Hamedata, awo Akak, awo usua mme Yuu. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Adidem amaabo Haman, “Nịm akʌk ado, nyʌñ nam ye idịd ami naña afo ama.”<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Akem ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ita ke akpa afiọñ emaekoot afịd mme awedñwed ukara. Ammọ emaewet ke ñwed afịd mme efaak ukara ye ke mme usem mme awo keedekeed afịd se Haman akewuuk ke abaña uyio adidem, ye ake mme adaukara ke afịd efaak ye ake mme mbọọñ. Ekewet ami ke anyịñ Adidem Seeses ke idem amọ enyʌñ efiik idiọọñọ ukara amọ ye ñkpannuun amọ. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Emaenọ ñwed esọk afịd mme efaak adidem ye ewʌhọ adisobo, ñwot ñnyʌñ nsọọk nsio ke iso isọñ afịd mme Yuu, ntək-ntək mme ikpọ, ibaan ye ntəkayịn, ke usen keed, ayọhọ duob mme ita ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme iba, ke afiọñ Adaa, ñko adinyʌñ mbịme inie ammọ. <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Akena nte enam ewʌhọ ami ado mbed ke afịd idịd enyʌñ enam nọ mme awo ediọọñọ anye ke afịd ederimbod nọ ammọ ebeeñe idem ebaña usen ado.<verse eid="EST 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Mme anọ ñwed emaewuọñọ ekaa, eyọhọ ye uko ato ke ewʌhọ adidem, ndin emaenọ mbed ami ke sitadeel Susa. Adidem ye Haman emaetie enwọñ ñkpọ, ado abio Susa akeba ke ataa ñkpaidem.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mọdekai Akpak Esta Ate Anwam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Ke ini Mọdekai amaakekop afịd se ekenam, anye amaawai afọñ amọ, asịne afọñikpo anyʌñ afiọññọ ntọñ, amaanyʌñ awuọ akaa abio, atua idod-idod ayịd ke akpọsọñ uyio. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Ado anye ikibọhọke inuaatob adidem, sia awo ikiyakka awo se isịne afọñikpo aboiyo adʌk. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Ke afịd idʌñ ake mbed ye ewʌhọ adidem akesịmme ekamba mfʌhọ amaaba ke ufọọd mme Yuu, ke utreudia, ayịd ye ñkpo. Uwak emaenaa ke afọñikpo ye ntọñ.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Ke ini mme itọ ye ifʌn ibaan abọọñanwaan Esta ekedidọkkọke anye ebaña Mọdekai, anye amaaba ke mfʌhọ. Anye amaanọ afọñ esọk Mọdekai ado anye ikinyịmmeke adibọ ammọ nsịne. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Ndin Esta amaakoot Hatak, keed ke atu mme itọ adidem akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña anye, anyʌñ adọñ anye yak akeduuñọ adiọọñọ me nsoo ido mfịna Mọdekai ye ntak.<verse eid="EST 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Ndin Hatak amaakaa abịne Mọdekai ke anwa esiin abio ke iso inuaatob adidem. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Mọdekai amaadọkkọ anye afịd ñkpọ se ikitịppe inọ anye, adiana ye ekọmudua ake Haman anwọñọke adikpe nsịn ke itie unịmakʌk adidem nọ esobo afịd mme Yuu. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />Anye amaanyʌñ anọ ayịnufọk Esta ñwed ewʌhọ ake Haman ayemme adisobo ammọ, emaekesio edian ke Susa, adiwọt Esta ñnyʌñ nnam nọ anwaña anye, ndin Mọdekai amaabo anye yak adọkkọ Esta nọ aka iso adidem akekpe ubọk anyʌñ abeeñe mbọm anọ mbon amọ.<verse eid="EST 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Hatak amaanyọñ anyʌñ akedọkkọ Esta se Mọdekai aketañ. <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Ndin Esta amaadọñ Hatak akedọkkọ Mọdekai abo, <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />“Afịd mme adaaha adidem ye mbon awo ke abio ediọọñọ ke awodeen me awonwaan akpeka abịne adidem ke esịd akwere amọ ke idaha adidem imiikoodo anie kpa mbed keed: ana nte ewot anye ibọhọke adidem anyan esañ ubọọñ kold anọ ammọ anyʌñ afeen uwem ammọ. Ado usen edịb mme duob aboiyo tọọñọ ekeñkoot ndʌk ñkekịt adidem.”<verse eid="EST 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Ke ini ekedọkkọke Mọdekai mme ikọ Esta, <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />Mọdekai amaadọñ ibọọrọ ami asọk Esta: “Kuukere ke sia afo amedʌñ ke ufọk adidem ke afo ikpọọñ ke afịd mme Yuu uduubọkkọ. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Sia adieke afo adoppo uyio ini ami, ubọkkọ ye adinyaaña ayaato itie mfen abịne mme Yuu, ado afo ye ufọk ete mfo eyaetak. Anie awo idiọọñọ me afo akedi ufọk adidem ke abaña ini ntom?”<verse eid="EST 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Ndin Esta amaanọ ibọọrọ ami esọk Mọdekai: <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />“Kaa, koot afịd mme Yuu se iba ke Susa bon, inyʌñ itie utreudia innọ miin. Ikiidia ñkpọ ikiinyʌñ inwọñ ñkpọ ke usen ita, akonayio ye uweemeayio. Ami ye nditọufọk mmi iyainyʌñ itie utreudia naña ndufo enam ñko. Ke emaenam ami, ami ñyaakaa mbịne adidem, akpesʌkado mbed akpanna. Ndin adieke ami ntakka, yak ntak.”<verse eid="EST 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Ndin Mọdekai amaawuọ anyọñ anyʌñ akenam afịd mme item Esta.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ebeeñe Esta Anọọhọ Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Ke ayọhọ usen ita Esta amaasịne afọñ ubọọñ amọ anyʌñ akedʌk esịd akwere adidem, ke iso afe adidem. Adidem aketie ke ebekpo ubọọñ amọ ke afe, ase ntondʌk. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Ke ini adidem akekịtte Abọọñanwaan Esta naña ada ke esịd akwere, anye amaakop inemesịd abaña anye anyʌñ anyan esañ ubọọñ a-akebaaha anye ke ubọk anọ anye. Ndin Esta amaasaña akpere anyʌñ atuuk mben esañ ubọọñ ado.<verse eid="EST 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Ndin adidem amaabịp ate, “Nsoo ido, Abọọñanwaan Esta? Nsoo ido ebeeñe mfo? Ñkọm ado mbaak keed abioubọọñ mmi, ñyaayaak unọ fiin.”<verse eid="EST 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Esta amaabọọrọ ate, “Adieke anemme adidem esịd, yak adidem ye Haman edi usọrọ ndia ami mbeeñeke nnọ anye mfịn ami.”<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Adidem amaabo, “Iben Haman idi ke usọp-usọp nọ ñnyịn inam se Esta abeeñe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:5">Akem adidem ye Haman emaekaa usọrọ ndia ake Esta akebeeñeke. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Ke idaha ammọ esʌkkọ enwọñ ukọd, adidem amaamaana abịp Esta “Idahami nsoo ido ebeeñe mfo? Eyaeyaak unọ fiin. Nsoo inyʌñ ido ebeeñe mfo? Ñkọm akpedo abio ukara mmi mbaakka iba, eyaenam unọ fiin.”<verse eid="EST 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Esta amaabọọrọ ate, “Akam mmi ye ebeeñe mmi edo mi: <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />Adieke adidem ammaaha miin ye mfọn, ñko adieke anemme adidem esịd adinọ ebeeñe mmi ñnyʌñ nnam ebeeñe mmi, yak adidem ye Haman edi usọrọ ndia ake ami ñyemme adinam ñkpọñ nnọọ ammọ. Ndin ami ñyaabọọrọ mbuume adidem.”<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haman Ayat Esịd abaña Mọdekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Haman amaanyọñ usen ado ye inemesịd anyʌñ aba ke sịbidịd idaara. Ado anye akekekịt Mọdekai ke inuaatob adidem anyʌñ adiọọñọ ke anye ikponoke imọ inyʌññọ ibaak imọ, anye amaayọhọ ye ifiobesịd abaña Mọdekai. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Ado Haman amaamʌm idem amọ akama anyʌñ anyọñ ufọk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:10">Adikoot mme ufan amọ ye anwaan amọ, Seres, abon, <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Haman amaanam inua anọ ammọ abaña mme uwak inie amọ, uwak nditọ ideen amọ, ye afịd usʌñ naña adidem ikpono imọ ye naña anye adịppe imọ akan afịd mme mbọọñ ye mme adaaha mfen. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Haman amaamaana adian do ate, “Ikweeñeke ke ado, ami ndo ukweeñe awo Abọọñanwaan Esta akoodo yak asaña ye adidem adi usọrọ anye akenamma. Anye anyʌñ amaana añkoot miin ye adidem ñkpọñ adiisiere mi. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Ado afịd mme ñkpọ ami innọọhọ miin uyʌkkọ adaña nte ami ñkịtte awo Yuu ado Mọdekai naña atie ke inuaatob adidem.”<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Anwaan amọ Seres ye afịd mme ufan amọ emaebo anye ete, “Wuuk eto anyọọñọ nte kubid aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 75 me ñkpọ nte mita 23</char></note>, ndin bo adidem ke ubakusen yak ekọọñ Mọdekai do. Ndin kaa usọrọ ndia ado ye adidem ke nọ idem mfo inemesịd.” Akikere ami amaanem Haman esịd, ndin anye amaadaaha eto ado.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ekpono Mọdekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Akonayio ado adidem ikikanna idaiya; ndin anye amaanọ uyio ate eben ñwed nti utom edikʌppọ enyʌñ ekoot inọ imọ. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Emaekịt naña ewet ebo ke Mọdekai amaayaara idiọọk uduak Biktana ye Teres, mme adaaha adidem iba e-ekesikpemeke inuausʌñ, e-ekeduakka adiwot Adidem Seeses.<verse eid="EST 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Adidem amaabịp ate, “Nsoo ukpono ke ekenọọ Mọdekai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Ayịnufọk amọ amaabọọrọ ate, “Ibaaha se ekenam enọ anye.”<verse eid="EST 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Adidem amaabo ate, “Anie awo iba ke afe abọọñ?” Haman amaadʌk akwere abọọñ idaha ado adineme ye adidem mbaña adikọọñ Mọdekai ke eto a-anye akedaahake anọ Mọdekai.<verse eid="EST 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Nditọufọk amọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Haman mmọdo ada ke akwere.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:5">Adidem amaanọ uyio ate, “Eben anye edʌk edi.”<verse eid="EST 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Ke Haman amaakedʌk, adidem amaabịp anye ate, “Nsoo ke ekpenam enọ awo adidem anemme esịd adikpono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:6">Ndin Haman amaakere ke esịd amọ ate, “Anie awo ke adidem akpekpono ke imiibọhọke ami?” <verse eid="EST 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Ndin Haman amaabọọrọ adidem ate, “Awo adidem anemme esịd adikpono, <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" />yak eben afọñ ubọọñ adidem asisịneke ye enañmbakara adidem asiwatta, anye edotto idiọọñọ ubọọñ ke iwuod. <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />Ndin yak eyaak afọñ ubọọñ ye enañmbakara ami enọ keed ke atu mbọọñ a-adidem anieghe idodanyen akan. Yak ammọ esịn awo adidem anemme esịd ayem adikpono afọñ, enyʌñ eben anye ke enañ esaña ke mme efaak ke abio ebo ete, ‘Se enam enọ awo anemme adidem esịd ado mi!’ ”<verse eid="EST 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Adidem amaanọ Haman uyio ate, “Kaa usọp-usọp ben afọñ ubọọñ ye enañmbakara nyʌñ nam naña afo aketañ nọ Mọdekai awo Yuu a-atieghe ke inuaatob adidem. Kuusio ñkpọ ndomokeed se afo asiak uduọk.”<verse eid="EST 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Ndin Haman amaaben afọñ ubọọñ ye enañmbakara. Anye amaasịn Mọdekai afọñ ubọọñ, anyʌñ aben anye ke anyọñ enañmbakara asaña ke mme efaak ke abio, anyʌñ abọñ ate, “Se enam enọ awo ake adidem anemme esịd adikpono ado mi!”<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Akema Mọdekai amaatịmme anyọñ inuaatob adidem. Ado Haman amaasọsọp anyọñ ufọk, ayọhọ ye mfʌhọ, <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Haman anyʌñ akedọkkọ anwaan amọ Seres ye afịd mme ufan amọ se ikitịppe inọ anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:13">Mme anọitem amọ ye anwan amọ Seres emaebo anye ete, “Sia iduọ mfo atọọñọke ke iso Mọdekai, a-adooho awo Yuu, afo uduukanna adida ikọ ye anye, afo ayaaduọ!” <verse eid="EST 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Ke ini ammọ esʌkkọ etatañ ikọ ye anye, mme itọ adidem emaedi adiben Haman ñkaa usọrọ ake Esta akebeeñeke.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="s1">Eyịt Haman ke Eto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Ndin adidem ye Haman emaekaa usọrọ ndia enọ Abọọñanwaan Esta, <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />ndin naña ammọ ekesʌkkọ enwọñ ukọd ke ayọhọ usen iba, adidem amaamaana abịp ate, “Abọọñanwaan Esta, nsoo ido ebeeñe mfo? Eyaunọ fiin. Nsoo ido ebeeñe mfo? Ñkọm akpedo mbaak keed ke abioubọọñ mmi, eyaenam unọ fiin.”<verse eid="EST 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Akem Abọọñanwaan Esta amaabọọrọ ate, “Abọọñ mmi, adieke ami ñkịtte mfọn ke iso mfo, ñko adieke unemme fiin esịd, nnọ miin uwem mmi, ebeeñe mmi ado mi. Nyʌñ yaak uwem mbio mmi, ebeeñe mmi ado mi. <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Sia emaeñnyam miin ye ikọd mmi enọ nsobo, ewot enyʌñ esọọk esio. Adieke adooho ekinyam ñnyịn nte ifʌn ideen ye ibaan ikpọọñ, ami ñkpaakedop uyio, sia ñkpọ ntom idotto adikifịna adidem.”<verse eid="EST 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Adidem Seeses amaabịp Abọọñanwaan Esta ate, “Anie ke anye ado? Mmọọ ke anye aba, awo adeeghede adinam utọ ñkpọ ami?”<verse eid="EST 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Esta amaabọọrọ ate, “Awo idiọọkesịd ye awo usua! Haman awo ndoom ami!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:6">Ndin ndịk amaanam Haman ke iso adidem ye abọọñanwaan. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Adidem amaadakka ada ke iyadesịd, akpọñ ukọd amọ anyʌñ awuọ akaa ke inwañ ufọk adidem. Ado Haman, ke ini adiọọñọke ke adidem amaabebiide se ikiinaa atịppe anọ anye, amaasọñọ ada adikpeiye Abọọñanwaan Esta mbaña uwem amọ.<verse eid="EST 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Kpa ke ukem ini adidem aketịmmeke adi itie usọrọ ndia, se Haman mi, mmọdo akekʌbọ ke ñkpọitie Esta aketieghe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Adidem amaasio ñkpo ate, “Ana nte anye afiọññọ abọọñanwaan ke idaha anye abaaha ye ami ke ufọk?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Kpa idaha i-ikọ ado awuọhọ ke inua adidem, emaefʌk iso Haman. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Akem Habona, keed ke atu mme itọ adidem amaabo ate, “Eto anyọọñọ ke ñkpọ nte kubid aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 75 me ñkpọ nte mita 23</char></note> mmọdo ada ke ufọk Haman. Anye akebeeñe ami anịm anọ Mọdekai, a-aketañña ikọ adinyaaña adidem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Adidem amaabo ate, “Ekọọñ anye do!” <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Ndin emaekọọñ Haman ke eto anye akewuuhọ anọ Mọdekai. Ndin iyadesịd adidem amaasuuhọ.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ewʌhọ Adidem ke Iwuod Mme Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Kpa ke usen ado Adidem Seeses amaanọ Abọọñanwaan Esta inie Haman, awo usua mme Yuu. Ndin Mọdekai amaadʌk adi iso adidem, sia Esta amaatañ naña imọ iwuana ñkpọ ye anye. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Adidem amaasio ñkpannuun amọ anye akebọọhọ Haman, ayaak anọ Mọdekai. Ndin Esta amaamek anye andise ñkpọ mbaña inie Haman.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Esta amaamaana akpeiye adidem, aduọ ke edọñ anyʌñ atua. Anye amaakpeiye anye ate yak atre ibak uduak Haman awo Akak, ake anye akeduakka abaña mbon Yuu. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Akem adidem amaanyan esañ ukwak kold anọ Esta ndin anye amaadakka ada ke iso amọ.<verse eid="EST 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />Anye amaabo ate, “Adieke anemme adidem esịd, ndin adieke anye anseeghe miin ye mfọn anyʌñ akere ke ado eti ñkpọ adinam, ñko anye akpenem esịd ye ami, yak ewet mbed a-abiada mme ñwed ake Haman ayịn Hamedata, awo Akak akesioho abaña adisobo afịd mme Yuu ke afịd mme abio ukara adidem. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Ami ñkeme die adikịt naña mfịna asịm mbon mmi? Ami ñkeme die adikịt naña esobo ufọk ñnyịn.”<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Adidem Seeses amaabọọrọ Abọọñanwaan Esta ye Mọdekai awo Yuu ate, “Sia Haman akenwanake mbon Yuu, ami mmeyaak inie amọ nnọ Esta, ñko eyịt anye ke eto anye akewuuhọ. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Idahami wet mbed mfen ke anyịñ adidem ke iwuod mbon Yuu naña afo akịt abo ke afọñ, nyʌñ dian idiọọñọ ñkpannuun ufiikñkpọ adidem, sia ibaaha ñwed e-ewette ke anyịñ adidem enyʌñ ekama ñkpannuun amọ efiik idiọọñọ nọ ekan ebiat.”<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Ke usọp emaekoot mme awedñwed nnọọ adidem ke ayọhọ usen edịb mme ita ke ayọhọ afiọñ ita, afiọñ Sifan. Ammọ emaewet afịd ewʌhọ Mọdekai enọ mme Yuu, ye mme adaukara, ye mme mbọọñ ke afịd abio ikie mme edịb mme itiaba (127) atọọñọ ke India tutu ke Kuus. Ekewet mme ewʌhọ ami ke ñwed mme abio keedekeed ye ke mme usem mme awo keedekeed ñko ake mme Yuu ke usem amọ. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Mọdekai akewet ke anyịñ Adidem Seeses, anịm idiọọñọ ye ñkpannuun ufiikñkpọ adidem, anyʌñ anọ ammọ ke ubọk mbon edọñ utom e-ekedoroke ke anyọñ enañmbakara, e-ekewatta mme asọbusọb enañmbakara a-adooho ekenam ammọ asaña-asaña enọ adidem.<verse eid="EST 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" />Ewʌhọ adidem amaanọ mme Yuu ke afịd abio unen adiboho keed ñnyʌñ ñkpeme idem ammọ; adisobo, ñwot ñnyʌñ nsọọk mbon ekọñ idịd akeedodo me abio ake eyemme anwan ye ammọ ye ibaan ammọ ye nditọ ammọ, ñko adinyʌñ mbịme inie asua ammọ. <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />Usen e-ekesioho enịm enọ mme Yuu adinam ami ke afịd ifịm ukara Adidem Seeses akedo ayọhọ usen duob mme ita ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme iba, afiọñ Adaa. <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Akena nte eben ukem ñwed ewʌhọ ami esịn ke mbed ke afịd abio enyʌñ enam afịd awo ke afịd idịd ediọọñọ mbaak mme Yuu eba ke mbeeñeidem ke usen ado adisio usiene ye mbon usua ammọ.<verse eid="EST 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Mme asuanetob, ewatta ke enañmbakara adidem, emaewuọ ekaa, ekop uko ato ewʌhọ adidem, enyʌñ esuan etob ami ke afịd sitadeel Susa.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adikan Mme Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Ke ini Mọdekai akekpọññọ iso adidem, anye akesịne mme afọñ ubọọñ e-edooho bru ye afia, ayara ekamba anyanya kold ye eti iduod-iduod afọñ linen. Ndin abio Susa emaedia usọrọ idaara. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Akedo ataa ini idadesịd ye idaara, inemesịd ye ukpono anọ mme Yuu. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Ke afịd abio ye idịd ake ewʌhọ adidem akesịmme, akwa idaara ye inemesịd amaaba ke atu mme Yuu, ye usọrọ ye ndia. Ndin uwak awo ke mme idịd mfen emaekappa edo mbon Yuu sia ndịk mbon Yuu amaamʌm ammọ.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ita ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme iba, ke afiọñ Adaa, akena nte enam ewʌhọ adidem usen ado. Mbon usua mme Yuu emaenie idodanyen adikan ammọ udịd ke usen ado, ado idahami eyʌt ñkpọ ekappa ndin mme Yuu emaenie edikan ebaña mbon se ikisua ammọ. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Mme Yuu emaeboho ke mme abio ammọ ke afịd abio Adidem Seeses adinwana ye mbon ekebeeñeke idem adisobo ammọ. Ibaaha awo se ikikan inwana ye ammọ, sia mme awo ke idịd mfen emaekop ndịk ebaña ammọ. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Ndin afịd mme mbọọñ ke mme abio, mme akara idʌñ, mme adaukara ye mme akama utom adidem emaenwam mme Yuu, sia ndịk Mọdekai amaamʌm ammọ. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Mọdekai amaawuọ etob ke ufọk adidem; etob amọ amaasuana ke afịd mme idʌñ, ndin anye amaanekke anie adudu.<verse eid="EST 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Mme Yuu emaewot mme asua ammọ eduọñọ ke isọñ ke akañkañ, ewot enyʌñ esobo ammọ, ndin ammọ emaenam se ammọ ekemama ye mbon usua ammọ. <verse eid="EST 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Ke sitadeel Susa, mme Yuu emaewot enyʌñ esobo awo ikie ition (500). <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />Ammọ emaewot Pasandata, Dalfon, Aspata, <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />Porata, Adalia, Aridata, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />Pamasta, Arisai, Aridai ye Faisata, <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" />nditọ ideen duob Haman ayịn Hamedata, awo usua mme Yuu. Ado ammọ ikituuho ñkpọ mbịme ado.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Emaedọkkọ adidem mme ibad awo se ekewot ke abio Susa usen ado. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Adidem amaadọkkọ Abọọñanwaan Esta ate, “Mme Yuu esobo ideen ikie ition (500) ye nditọ ideen Haman duob ke sitadeel Susa. Nsoo ke ammọ enam ke mme abio adidem mfen? Idahami nsoo ido ebeeñe mfo? Eyaunọ fiin. Nsoo ke ayem? Ñko eyaunọ fiin.”<verse eid="EST 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Esta amaabọọrọ ate, “Adieke anemme adidem esịd, nọ mme Yuu ke Susa uyio adika iso ñko nnam ewʌhọ ami, ndin yak ekọọñ nditọ ideen Haman duob ke eto.”<verse eid="EST 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Ndin adidem amaanọ uyio ate enam ntoro. Emaesio ewʌhọ ke Susa, ndin emaekọọñ nditọ ideen Haman duob ke eto. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Mme Yuu ke Susa emaesoobo ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke afiọñ Adaa, ndin ammọ emaewot ideen ikie ita (300) ke Susa, ado ammọ ikiyakka ubọk ammọ atuuk ñkpọ mbịme.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Ado, ubaak mbon Yuu se ikiba ke mme abio adidem emaenyʌñ esoobo idem adikpeme idem ammọ mbaak mbon usua ammọ. Emaewot mme asua ammọ awo tọsịn ata mme duob mme ition (75,000) ado ubọk ammọ ikituuho mme ñkpọ mbịme. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Afịd ami aketịppe ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ita ke afiọñ Adaa, ndin ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ammọ emaeduọk adudu enyʌñ enam anye ado usen usọrọ ye idaara.<verse eid="EST 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Mme Yuu ke Susa emaesoobo ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ita ye ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ, ndin ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition, ammọ emaeduọk adudu enyʌñ enam anye usen usọrọ ye idaara.<verse eid="EST 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Ntak ado anam mme Yuu, e-edʌññọ ke mme esịd idʌñ, enịmme ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke afiọñ Adaa nte usen idaara ye usen udia usọrọ, usen unọ emọ-emọ mme enọ.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etọọñọ Purim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Mọdekai amaawet mme ñkpọ ami anịm, ndin anye amaanọ ñwed esọk afịd mme Yuu ke mme abio Adidem Seeses, ke ñkpere ye ke anyan usʌñ, <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />adinam ammọ edia usọrọ ke isua ke isua ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ye ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke afiọñ Adaa <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />nte ini ake mme Yuu ekenieghe ubọkkọ eto mbon usua ammọ, ñko nte afiọñ ake mfʌhọ ammọ akekappake ado idaara, ñko ntuaña ammọ akappa ado usọrọ. Anye akewet ammọ adinịm mme usen ami nte usen usọrọ ye idaara adinyʌñ nnọọ mme awo enọ ndidia ñnyʌñ nnọọ mme uweene mme enọ.<verse eid="EST 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Ndin mme Yuu emaenyịmme adika iso nnam usọrọ ammọ emaeketọọñọ, enam afịd se Mọdekai akewet anọ ammọ. <verse eid="EST 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Sia Haman ayịn Hamedata, awo Akak, awo usua afịd mme Yuu, amaaduak adisobo mme Yuu ñnyʌñ <char style="tl">nsịn afia</char> (a-adooho, usịn ukañ) nnọọ ñwuudo ammọ ye nsobo ammọ. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Ado idaha adidem akediọọñọke abaña ibak ami, anye amaasio ñwed ewʌhọ ate yak idiọọk ake Haman akeyemme adinam mme Yuu adodo anye ke iwuod, ñko yak ekọọñ anye ye nditọ ideen amọ ke eto. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />(Ke ntoro ekekoot mme usen ami Purim, a-atooho ikọ <char style="tl">pur</char>.) Akeene afịd ñkpọ se ekewet ke ñwed ñko ye se ammọ ekekịt ye se ikitịppe inọ ammọ, <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" />mme Yuu emaebiere ke idem ammọ ete ke mmimọ ye emana ke emana ye afịd mbon se idiana ye mmimọ idiitreke adinịm usen ami ke afịd isua, ke usʌñ ewʌhọ ye ke ini enịmme. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Ana nte afịd ubon etoiyo enyʌñ enịm usen ami ke afịd emana, ke afịd idịd ye ke afịd abio. Ndin mme Yuu idiitreke adidia usọrọ usen Purim, me eyak nọ mme usen emi ekpa ke atu nditọ ammọ.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Ndin Abọọñanwaan Esta, ayịn awonwaan Abihel, amaadiana ye Mọdekai awo Yuu, ewet ñwed ye ayọhọ uko adisọọñọ udiana ñwedetob atañña abaña Purim ami. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Ndin Mọdekai amaanọ mme ñwed esọk afịd mme Yuu ke afịd mme abio Seeses ikie keed mme edịb mme itiaba (127), etob ekọọm mfọn ye etob idọñesịd, <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />adinịm mme usen Purim ami ke ayọhọ ini amọ, naña Mọdekai awo Yuu ye Abọọñanwaan Esta emaekesọọñọ enọ ammọ, ñko naña ammọ emaekenịm enọ idem ammọ ye ubon ammọ abaña mme ini utreudia ye aseeme. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Ewʌhọ Esta amaasọọñọ mme mbed ami abaña Purim, ndin emaewet esịn ke ñwed.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s1">Uwuọetob Mọdekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Adidem Seeses amaadot isob ke afịd edem ukara amọ, tutu ke mme anyan idịd. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Ndin afịd mme adudu ye uku amọ, adiana ye ayọhọ adudu Mọdekai, ake adidem akedịppeke idaha, ado nte awo iwette ammọ ke ñwed utom adidem Media ye Pesia? <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Mọdekai awo Yuu akedo udiana Adidem Seeses, awuọ etob ke atu mme Yuu, enyʌñ enịm anye ke ekamba itie ke atu mme Yuu ammọ, sia anye amaanam utom ke ufọn afịd mbon amọ anyʌñ atañ ikọ ke ufọn afịd mme Yuu.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>